<rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>MedTech Dive - Latest News</title><link>https://www.medtechdive.com/news/</link><description>MedTech industry news</description><atom:link href="https://www.medtechdive.com/feeds/news/" rel="self"/><language>en</language><lastBuildDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 09:53:24 -0500</lastBuildDate><item><title>Medtech earnings: Surgery slowdown takes a toll</title><link>https://www.medtechdive.com/news/medtech-earnings-surgery-slowdown-takes-a-toll/875737/</link><description>&lt;figure&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;img src="https://imgproxy.divecdn.com/JroMTiEO1J3X0W6sE138eLmgWx8i_zGjfigjLKYeNeU/g:ce/rs:fill:1600:900:1/Z3M6Ly9kaXZlc2l0ZS1zdG9yYWdlL2RpdmVpbWFnZS9HZXR0eUltYWdlcy0xMTcwMTc2NjYxLmpwZw==.webp"/&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;p&gt;Lower surgical volumes weighed on results for some top medical device makers in the latest quarter, but not all companies saw an impact. MedTech Dive&amp;rsquo;s coverage roundup breaks it down.&lt;/p&gt;</description><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Susan Kelly</dc:creator><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 09:53:24 -0500</pubDate><guid>https://www.medtechdive.com/news/medtech-earnings-surgery-slowdown-takes-a-toll/875737/</guid></item><item><title>Insulet names Todd Trapp as CFO</title><link>https://www.medtechdive.com/news/insulet-names-todd-trapp-as-cfo/875711/</link><description>&lt;figure&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;img src="https://imgproxy.divecdn.com/bKyPPPQw2392XYGvmrvgPkvo0mD115NMdjA__pU5yp4/g:ce/rs:fill:1600:900:1/Z3M6Ly9kaXZlc2l0ZS1zdG9yYWdlL2RpdmVpbWFnZS9JbnN1bGV0X09tbmlwb2RfNV9kZXhjb21fc29jY2VyLmpwZw==.webp"/&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;p&gt;Insulet is changing CFOs 14 months after appointing Flavia Pease to the role.&lt;/p&gt;</description><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Nick Paul Taylor</dc:creator><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 09:00:00 -0500</pubDate><guid>https://www.medtechdive.com/news/insulet-names-todd-trapp-as-cfo/875711/</guid></item><item><title>MiniMed targets competition with upcoming diabetes devices</title><link>https://www.medtechdive.com/news/minimed-targets-competition-with-upcoming-diabetes-devices/875637/</link><description>&lt;figure&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;img src="https://imgproxy.divecdn.com/Khd3zSA5bafPUm1E7YyWd3pLxLD1Br3_ULin8BVmrdA/g:nowe:0:171/c:852:481/rs:fill:1600:900:1/Z3M6Ly9kaXZlc2l0ZS1zdG9yYWdlL2RpdmVpbWFnZS9NaW5pTWVkX0ZpdF8yLmpwZw==.webp"/&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;p&gt;CEO Que Dallara said the company aims to give people a reason to switch with the launch of MiniMed&amp;rsquo;s first insulin patch pump.&lt;/p&gt;</description><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Elise Reuter</dc:creator><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 11:28:23 -0500</pubDate><guid>https://www.medtechdive.com/news/minimed-targets-competition-with-upcoming-diabetes-devices/875637/</guid></item><item><title>Medtronic continues to see growth in cardiovascular business</title><link>https://www.medtechdive.com/news/medtronic-continues-to-see-growth-in-cardiovascular-business/875613/</link><description>&lt;figure&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;img src="https://imgproxy.divecdn.com/oJCixz9dvLad9k78nsdzalCm9M0nSD-qrieQQ_YTJ4o/g:ce/rs:fill:1600:900:1/Z3M6Ly9kaXZlc2l0ZS1zdG9yYWdlL2RpdmVpbWFnZS8yVENQMktQLmpwZw==.webp"/&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;p&gt;The cardiovascular unit grew by double digits in the company&amp;rsquo;s fiscal second quarter, supported by its cardiac ablation solutions portfolio.&lt;/p&gt;</description><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Ricky Zipp</dc:creator><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 10:35:48 -0500</pubDate><guid>https://www.medtechdive.com/news/medtronic-continues-to-see-growth-in-cardiovascular-business/875613/</guid></item><item><title>Heraeus pulls vascular guidewires over coating detachment risk</title><link>https://www.medtechdive.com/news/heraeus-pulls-vascular-guidewires-over-coating-detachment-risk/875585/</link><description>&lt;figure&gt;&lt;div&g